siriushq/netbsd_src
===================

NetBSD is a free, fast, secure, and highly portable Unix-like
open-source operating system.

This repository hosts a mirror of the source code, available in the
`upstream` branch, retrieved from the official Git mirror of the CVS
repository, tracking `trunk`.  There are several guides for developers
and users, the formatted guide is available at:

	https://www.netbsd.org/docs/guide/en/